+원시 로그:
+
+- `logs/task01_gtsam_configure.log`
+- `logs/task01_gtsam_build.log`
+- `logs/task01_gtsam_install.log`
+- `logs/task01_colcon_build.log` 및 `ws/log/latest_build/lio_sam/`
